{"title":"Saturday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/953259419/0/marginalrevolution~Saturday-assorted-links.html","date":1775319287000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/ziiiico/status/2016188069830132178\" target=\"_blank\">Nyege Nyege Tapes</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://vamoul.substack.com/p/does-it-help-to-be-religious?utm_campaign=post-expanded-share&amp;utm_medium=post%20viewer&amp;triedRedirect=true\" target=\"_blank\">Does it help poets to be religious?</a></p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.theideasletter.org/essay/martin-jays-habermas/\" target=\"_blank\">Martin Jay on Habermas</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4.<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/econcallum/status/2039824461265006756?s=46\" target=\"_blank\"> U.S. prime age employment rate is near an all-time high</a>.  For a different perspective, here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/03/business/economists-once-dismissed-the-ai-job-threat-but-not-anymore.html?campaign_id=190&amp;emc=edit_ufn_20260403&amp;instance_id=173568&amp;nl=from-the-times&amp;regi_id=168807750&amp;segment_id=217713&amp;user_id=77dddeadf63367909fe4e3e3e981873f\" target=\"_blank\">NYT on AI and the job market</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://futuretech.mit.edu/publication/crashing-waves-vs-rising-tides-preliminary-findings-on-ai-automation-from-thousands-of-worker-evaluations-of-labor-market-tasks\" target=\"_blank\">new measures of AI task performance from MIT</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.chinatalk.media/p/chinas-ai-education-experiment?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=4220&amp;post_id=190443140&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">China’s AI education experiment</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/mattyglesias/status/2040034225659781435\" target=\"_blank\">Real retail U.S. electricity prices have fallen since 2010</a>.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://hackney.app/\" target=\"_blank\">Compare ride-share prices</a>.</p>\r\n<p>8. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.oldnorthwhale.com/p/why-modern-chinese-is-just-english?ref=thebrowser.com\" target=\"_blank\">Is Mandarin being Europeanized?</a></p>\r\n<p>9. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/anitaleirfall/status/2040104926001418740\" target=\"_blank\">2000 or so additional pages of Leibniz will be published</a>.</p>\r\n<p>10. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/profgoose/status/2040200881698934957\" target=\"_blank\">The game theory of the NCAA EO</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/04/saturday-assorted-links-555.html\">Saturday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/953259419/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/953259419/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/953259419/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/953259419/marginalrevolution\"><img height=